# Compass Gnome: "When this creature enters, you may search your library for a basic land card or Cave card, reveal it, then
# shuffle and put that card on top." Bot1 accepts and may find only a basic land card or a Cave card: Bloodstained Mire (a
# nonbasic land that is no Cave) and Lightning Bolt are refused; Captivating Cave (a nonbasic Cave) is found, revealed and ends
# on top, so it is turn 3's draw (CR 701.23, 701.20, 205.3i). Bot2's library is not searched: its own Captivating Cave stays in it (twelve cards after its turn 2 draw).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Compass Gnome
Island x4
Bloodstained Mire
Lightning Bolt
Captivating Cave
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Captivating Cave
Swamp x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Compass Gnome.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Accept
! Bot1.Search(Bloodstained Mire)
! Bot1.Search(Lightning Bolt)
Bot1.Search(Captivating Cave)
? Bot1.Revealed = Captivating Cave
[T3 Bot1.Main1]

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand = Island; Island; Island; Island; Captivating Cave
Bot1.Battlefield.Compass Gnome.Power = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Compass Gnome.Toughness = 1
Bot2.Library.Count = 12
